achievement: long_strike
face-image: img/events/pit_rally.jpg

= The March Back

After [+ strike_months +] months, a special delegate conference of the NUM votes to go back to work without an agreement. In the pit villages, the miners march back behind their colliery bands and banners. No union will challenge a government like this again for a generation, and the closures that follow will empty whole valleys.

@lights_out
title: The Lights Go Out
tags: event
view-if: con_in_government = 1 and miners_strike = 1 and strike_strength >= 85 and coal_stocks < 2 and (month >= 11 or month <= 2)
max-visits: 1
